Article 56 Where any entity, in violation of this Law, commits any of the following acts, the market regulation department of the local people's government shall order it to make corrections within a prescribed period; it may be fined not less than 5,000 yuan but not more than 50,000 yuan; if it fails to make corrections within the prescribed period, its business license shall be revoked according to law; if losses are caused, it shall bear compensation liability according to law:
(1) Selling reused electrical and electronic products without reuse product labels;
(2) Selling remanufactured or refurbished products without remanufactured or refurbished product labels.
